      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "§6Ilmenite§r is a mineral that serves as a natural source of titanium. It is produced by centrifuging §6Titanium Ore§r. By itself, it can be placed in an §3Arc Furnace§r to produce 3 §6Titanium Ingots§r, or it can be further processed in a §3Chemical Plant§r using §bTitanium Tetrachloride§r to increase its yield. The most efficient recipe is in the §3Pyrolysis Oven§r, where on top of giving the most titanium per Ilmenite, it also recycles back all the §bChlorine§r.\n\nQuest requirements: Obtain §6Ilmenite§r by centrifuging §6Titanium Ore§r. Build an §3Arc Furnace§r, §3Chemical Plant§r, or §3Pyrolysis Oven§r. Produce at least one §6Titanium Ingot§r from §6Ilmenite§r. For maximum efficiency, use the §3Pyrolysis Oven§r and recover §bChlorine§r.\n\n[F1] For more information.",
